uAu4Q3IcHCFooCA",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_ATMOSPHERE_ASPECT"],"氣氛",null,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwiEn6yHvNKWAxXBePUHHe3uAu4Q3IcHCFsoCQ",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_DISH_RECOMMENDATION"],"你推薦哪道料理？",null,[[[["M:/g/11qzc0q30g"],"柑橘鹽味拉麵",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiEn6yHvNKWAxXBePUHHe3uAu4Q3YcHCF0oAA"],[["M:/g/11vs5p_5v5"],"迷你叉燒飯",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiEn6yHvNKWAxXBePUHHe3uAu4Q3YcHCF4oAQ"]],[1]],null,"建議的餐點",null,"0ahUKEwiEn6yHvNKWAxXBePUHHe3uAu4Q3IcHCFwoCg",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_WAIT_TIME"],"候位時間多久？",[[[["E:DINING_WAIT_TIME_10_TO_30_MIN"],"10 到 30 分鐘",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiEn6yHvNKWAxXBePUHHe3uAu4Q3YcHCGAoAA"]],1],null,null,"等待時間",null,"0ahUKEwiEn6yHvNKWAxXBePUHHe3uAu4Q3IcHCF8oCw",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["• 經典柑橘鹽味拉麵： 湯頭非常溫潤，入喉時帶有淡淡的橘子清香，平衡感抓得很好，完全不會有衝突感。特別喜歡這種細拉麵條，吸附湯汁的能力極佳，每一口都帶有鮮甜的果香。叉燒部分也非常軟嫩，入口即化。\n• 乾拉麵： 麵條跟湯拉麵不同，採用的是有嚼勁的粗麵，Q彈有力。店家的調味比例掌握得神準，醬汁能完美掛在每一根麵條上，香氣濃郁，非常過癮。\n• MINI叉燒飯：炙燒過後的叉燒香味十足，搭配店家煮的米飯和特製的醬汁，真的很好吃，即便吃了拉麵肚子已經很飽了還是不知不覺吃完了。\n\n喜歡吃辣的朋友，建議嘗試店家的辣味噌，加入湯頭後有畫龍點睛的效果，層次感瞬間提升。\n\n特別要提一下店家免費提供的蔬菜高湯。在等待或餐後取用一杯，口感非常鮮甜好喝，感覺得出店家連附贈的湯水都非常用心製作，絕對要喝喝看。\n\n不管是想喝清爽溫潤的湯頭，還是想吃有嚼勁的拌麵，這裡都能滿足。尤其是柑橘與拉麵的結合非常創新且成功，是台北絕對值得回訪的拉麵店。",null,[0,167]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15578589045687056626/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF6TlZkRVdtaE9NbHAzWWxoSmQyUXpUVEpVV0ZwdllrZEdWbGR1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15578589045687056626/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF6TlZkRVdtaE9NbHAzWWxoSmQyUXpUVEpVV0ZwdllrZEdWbGR1WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/15578589045687056626/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF6TlZkRVdtaE9NbHAzWWxoSmQyUXpUVEpVV0ZwdllrZEdWbGR1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15578589045687056626/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5v